      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Pick Fungus, Tree or Vine when you cast. The spirit appears within 90 ft, is an ally, shares your initiative (acting right after you) and obeys your commands; it Dodges if you give none. Its AC, Hit Points and attack damage grow with the slot level, and its attacks use your spell attack bonus. It makes attacks equal to half the spell's level. It disappears at 0 Hit Points or when your concentration ends.</p>",
